  "description": "HyperLiquid DEX client for .NET — REST (Info + Exchange) and WebSocket with EIP-712 signing (L1 action-signed via the phantom-agent struct, plus user-signed flavour for transfers/approvals), pre-flight order validation (tick / lot / min-notional), REST retry policy with backoff + jitter (honours Retry-After on 429), automatic builder-fee routing with one-shot approveBuilderFee, and WebSocket gap recovery on user streams (REST catch-up + dedup on reconnect). Implements EasyTrading.Abstractions plus HyperLiquid-specific surface (vaults, staking, builder fees).",
